  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Pandemoniac Corruption, Ability Focus (pandemoniac corruption), Knowledge (the planes) 9 ranks, outsider native to a chaos aligned plane.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Your pandemoniac corruption only incubates for the duration of the encounter after your victim has been injured by your natural attacks. One full round after the disease manifests the creature suffers 1 point of Constitution per round until he dies at 0 Constitution (which may be immediately considering the 1d10+5 penalty to Constitution).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/agent-of-chaos-creature#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
